    "alt": "放學後的學校操場草地上，一群穿著運動服的國中男女學生正在進行足球隊練習，教練在一旁指導傳球動作，陽光灑在球場上。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "As classes end, Kevin packs his bag and asks Mia, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "What time does ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-time-does-practice-start"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "practice",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-time-does-practice-start"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "practice"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " start?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-time-does-practice-start"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "放學鐘聲響起，Kevin 收拾背包並問 Mia：「練習什麼時候開始？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/sports-practice/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "924a38f3385fd7a6d479159bfa3c348b1b81be1747cd0f9b439e4afd6382095c",
        "sha256": "a69b3d67748ad3dc8d1fa74368411eee4c71ff4a8feea0a05a4eeedbf216f142"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mia ties her sneakers and says, “It starts at four o'clock. "
        },
        {
          "text": "See you on the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "see-you-on-the-field"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "field",
          "phraseIds": [
            "see-you-on-the-field"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "field"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "see-you-on-the-field"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Mia 繫好球鞋鞋帶並說：「四點開始。球場上見。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/sports-practice/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "1d5c1db1c58f8cfe0e90228c751b209092828874678ced023223d5c47a06883b",
        "sha256": "a15fa5152454aa061ade4887fd0b2043c795790ab18056e3f644540a5c986990"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Soon, the whole soccer "
        },
        {
          "text": "team",
          "wordIds": [
            "team"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " gathers on the sports "
        },
        {
          "text": "field",
          "wordIds": [
            "field"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " around their "
        },
        {
          "text": "coach",
          "wordIds": [
            "coach"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "不久後，整個足球隊聚集在球場上，圍繞在教練身邊。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/sports-practice/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "cdb60263db69249c4052cb907d08f299a4da8a592b31327222aeb21508c0640e",
        "sha256": "974520d2803d993205b9ab3477d90fbcff918c6f0f196363222567e0be855051"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "text": "coach",
          "wordIds": [
            "coach"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " blows his whistle and explains the drill for Friday's big "
        },
        {
          "text": "game",
          "wordIds": [
            "game"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "教練吹響哨子，為週五的重要比賽講解訓練動作。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/sports-practice/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "30ea9035a6e2c4a9ea17fadb7bb6ba8789d3df4f7b958adb22331bfed8211b55",
        "sha256": "2a6c9d3508cdb9dcbeee4982a21148faaa6fc58eb5bc9b3fb672dce8f8fae5ad"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "During drills, Kevin receives the ball and makes a crisp "
        },
        {
          "text": "pass",
          "wordIds": [
            "pass"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to his teammate."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在訓練過程中，Kevin 接住球並俐落地傳球給隊友。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/sports-practice/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "0de65c44e2e2c25c4c933420b29b70645b7c55fbd222d0a8b28f5acf7966770e",
        "sha256": "1e96a11ee933bab56f418223129ce8284a65f43c9476e06066d67948101bc4be"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nice ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "nice-pass"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pass",
          "phraseIds": [
            "nice-pass"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "pass"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "nice-pass"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "” shouts Mia as she kicks the soccer ball into the net."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「傳得好！」Mia 將足球踢入球門時大喊著。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/sports-practice/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "874dfd1b6877068ea27766a0569f98fc33037f229f91c26d89b65fcc2b55e04b",
        "sha256": "200c75228cd88672d66aa5cb9a2418458f894aa1a7b9967167b40199090e6eba"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Before heading home, the players gather in a circle and say, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's do our best.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-do-our-best"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在回家之前，球員們圍成一圈說：「我們全力以赴吧。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/sports-practice/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "8e0f062b9fb59f536afdf3ef9c3717257f52142faaf6cffe35244ffde7d0b3e0",
        "sha256": "feba26680024b0cee41ff336bad1bbe50aed043a7d65cf04ef6337ac6f44070c"
      }
    }
  ],
